    "%@%@\n\n新一轮会从目标当前画面开始。为避免缺少前段，请先让页面回到本次截图开始的位置（通常是页面起点）。如果页面尚未复位，请先取消，复位后再发起；如果已经复位，可直接重新框选。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@%@\n\nA new attempt starts from the target's current view. To avoid missing the beginning, return the page to the position where this capture started, usually the top. If it has not been reset, cancel and try again after resetting it. If it is already reset, select the area again."
          }
        }
      }
